    "url": "https://example.com/ai-agents",
    "markdown_content": "# Understanding AI Agent Architecture\n\nThis article explores modern AI agent design patterns.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[User Input] --> B[Agent Core]\n    B --> C[Tool Selection]\n    C --> D[Execution]\n    D --> E[Response]\n```\n\nThe system follows a modular approach.\n\n## Key Components\n\n- **Agent Core:** Central decision-making module\n- **Tool Registry:** Available actions and APIs\n- **Memory:** Context and conversation history\n\n## Implementation\n\n```python\nclass Agent:\n    def __init__(self, tools):\n        self.tools = tools\n        self.memory = []\n    \n    def process(self, input):\n        return self.decide(input)\n```\n\n## Conclusion\n\nAI agents represent the future of autonomous systems."
